stateDiagram-v2
 direction LR
 state "在干活" as active
 state "释放进程" as retiring
 state "退下待命" as standby
 state "核对并拉起" as resuming
 state "恢复出问题" as failed
 state "明确重新开始" as fallback
 active --> retiring: 阶段完成已确认
 retiring --> standby: 后台进程也已退出
 standby --> resuming: 被打回或需继续
 resuming --> active: 原对话与权限核对通过
 resuming --> failed: 无法确认或超时
 failed --> fallback: 满足安全条件
 fallback --> active: 保留节点，标明丢上下文
